        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Rocky/scene_dugong.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b77849fb-5e15-4e18-ab07-3c3354af7939).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47\r\rThanks to your work in Marrakech, we now know more about the Blue Blood operative known as &apos;the Inquisitor&apos;. We know that he is connected to a band of criminals called &apos;The Handprint&apos;. The Inquisitor got some kind of weapon from them. The Handprint&apos;s leaders, Joyo and Chintanika will probably have intel about the Inquisitor, which is essential to take him out. Be quick though, because Joyo has been captured by pirates and will not be here for long. \r\rGood luck 47",
